# Documentation is part of "done"

Any change that adds or alters a **feature**, **behavior**, **API/event contract**, or **architecture** is NOT complete until relevant docs are updated in the **same change**.

**Exempt:** typos, formatting, internal refactors with zero behavior change.

## What to update (pick what applies)

| Change type | Update |
|-------------|--------|
| Architectural / cross-cutting decision | New or updated ADR in `docs/adr/` |
| Product scope or module behavior | Owning app `PRD.md` and/or `TZ.md` |
| API, SSO, or event contract | `docs/INTEGRATION_SSO_EVENTS.md` + app docs |
| New satellite capability / readiness | `docs/SATELLITE_DOCUMENTATION.md`, `docs/READINESS_MATRIX.md`, `docs/COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` |
| Feature SHIPPED vs API-only / STUB | `docs/COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` + DELIVERY tag `[x]`/`[~]`/`[s]`/`[h]` — see `era-coverage-definition.mdc` |
| UI class (NONE / SCREEN / SHOW vs missing screen) | [`docs/acceptance/UI-COVERAGE-BOARD.md`](../docs/acceptance/UI-COVERAGE-BOARD.md) + Product-Readiness `## UI (short)` — not a sell SSOT |
| Product sell/show / pilot honesty | `docs/acceptance/*-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md` + Implementation-Matrix + `docs/editions/*.yaml` — see `docs/products/ERA-Acceptance-Standard.md` |
| Bank scope boundary (IN/OUT vs full ABS) | `docs/acceptance/Bank-Capability-Inventory.md` + Bank Acceptance-System / PRD §11 — AC ✅ ≠ full commercial bank |
| Control-plane / billing | `docs/CONTROL_PLANE_ARCHITECTURE.md` or matching `docs/*.md` |
| New API route or domain area | App `<app>-module-map.mdc` in `.cursor/rules/` |
| Dev ports / env vars | `docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md` and app `*-local-dev.mdc` |
| Schema / integration boundary (MDM, hub, workforce) | `npm run audit:integration:strict`; shrink baseline if wave complete — [INTEGRATION_AUDIT_CI.md](../docs/INTEGRATION_AUDIT_CI.md) |

## Workflow

1. Before finishing: "What did this change make true or false in the docs?"
2. Update docs together with code (same commit/PR).
3. After a delivery wave: refresh readiness via `.cursor/skills/era-readiness-matrix/SKILL.md` when applicable; update `docs/COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` actor columns for touched capabilities.
4. SHIPPED requires UAT-SMOKE **UI** path (not curl-only for ops/admin flows).
4. If unsure which doc fits — prefer an ADR over leaving it undocumented.

## Self-check

- [ ] Feature/behavior/contract/architecture changed? → A doc was updated.
- [ ] New decision with trade-offs? → ADR exists.
- [ ] New route/module? → Module map rule updated.
- [ ] No silent drift between code and docs.
- [ ] COVERAGE_MATRIX row updated with Ops / SatAdmin / OrgOwner / SuperAdmin where applicable.
- [ ] Product-Readiness / Implementation-Matrix updated when sell/show or AC status changed.
- [ ] DELIVERY `[x]` only for SHIPPED or documented HEADLESS.
